<p>Hello,</p>
<p>The export of your EsignCenter account, <strong><%= @current_account.name %></strong>, is ready to download.</p>
<p>It is a single zip file (<%= @size %>) holding your uploaded documents, every completed signed document, the audit trails, your templates, a CSV of all your submissions, and a manifest listing every file with its checksum.</p>
<p><strong><%= link_to 'Download your export', @export_url %></strong></p>
<% if @missing_count.positive? %>
  <p><strong><%= @missing_count %> expected file(s) could not be included.</strong> They are listed in the zip's <code>manifest.json</code> under "missing", each with the reason — either the file is no longer in our storage, or it was never generated.</p>
<% end %>
<p>You will be asked to sign in first — the file is never linked to directly. The download stays available for <%= @days %> days, until <strong><%= @expires_on %></strong>, and is then deleted automatically. You can always ask for a new one.</p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
